## Findings

**Active Alerts (7 total in the last 24 hours):**
- **REGISTRATION_STORM (CRITICAL)** on AMF (Jan 16 16:37–16:42): CPU utilization dropped 8%, authentication success rate dropped 11.7%.
- **REGISTRATION_STORM (CRITICAL)** on SMF (Jan 17 07:12–07:17): Session establishment rate dropped 17.8%.
- **RESOURCE_EXHAUSTION (MAJOR)** on UPF (Jan 17 02:42–02:47): Packet processing rate dropped 17.6%, buffer utilization dropped 6%, latency dropped 19.9%.
- **RESOURCE_EXHAUSTION (MAJOR)** on SMF (Jan 16 12:22–12:27): Session establishment rate dropped 15%, N4 message rate dropped 17.7%.
