- **SESSION_MANAGEMENT_FAILURE (MAJOR)** on AMF (Jan 17 00:47–00:52): Session setup rate dropped 18.2%.
- **SESSION_MANAGEMENT_FAILURE (MAJOR)** on UPF (Jan 17 06:37–06:42): Tunnel establishment rate dropped 15.5%.

**KPI Summary (last 60 minutes):**
- **AMF:** CPU mean 38.88% (max 43.26%), Memory mean 51.72% (max 58.15%), Registration rate mean 129.33 (max 145.63), Session setup rate mean 103.06 (max 114.97).
- **SMF:** CPU mean 45.28% (max 51.6%), Memory mean 58.27% (max 66.54%), Session establishment rate mean 116.15 (max 132.47).
- **UPF:** CPU mean 51.54% (max 58.23%), Memory mean 64.63% (max 71.16%), Buffer utilization mean 39.04% (max 44.61%), Packet drop rate mean 0.13% (max 0.15%), Latency mean 12.81ms (max 14.23ms).

**Anomalies Detected (Isolation Forest, 2% contamination):**
